1: # Automated Test Suite & Verification Harness Specification (app/test-m5.js)
2: **Document**: `test_m5_spec.md`  
3: **Milestone**: Milestone 5 — Media Player Architecture & TV Playback Overlay  
4: **Author**: `explorer_m5_3` (Player Test Harness Explorer & Verification Architect)  
5: **Target Platform**: LG webOS TV (webOS 8.5.0 / Chromium ~108+)  
6: **Target Device**: LG 32LR686BPSA (1920 × 1080 Full HD Canvas)  
7: **Peer Artifacts**: `player_engine_spec.md` (`explorer_m5_1`), `player_osd_spec.md` (`explorer_m5_2`)  
