504: ### 3.4 1080p Layout Geometry Mocks for OSD Controls
505: Coordinates strictly adhere to the 1920x1080 canvas and 5% TV-safe margin boundaries (X: 96px–1824px, Y: 54px–1026px):
506: 
507: ```javascript
508: function installLayoutMock(window) {
509:   function makeRect(left, top, width, height) {
